           "id": "c7c64dcb",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p><strong>On this page</strong></p><ol data-sva-toc><li><a href=\"#s1\">Who these terms apply to</a></li><li><a href=\"#s2\">Prices and VAT</a></li><li><a href=\"#s3\">Ordering ICSI semen</a></li><li><a href=\"#s4\">Delivery and shipping</a></li><li><a href=\"#s5\">Guarantees</a></li><li><a href=\"#s6\">Payment</a></li><li><a href=\"#s7\">Papers and registration</a></li><li><a href=\"#s8\">Health and veterinary</a></li><li><a href=\"#s9\">Cancelling an order</a></li><li><a href=\"#s10\">Liability</a></li><li><a href=\"#s11\">Which law applies</a></li></ol><p class=\"sva-stamp\">This page is a framework, not a contract. Every block marked in gold is waiting for the owners to say what their terms actually are, and until they do nothing on this page binds anyone.</p>",
